                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e5857027-db7b-3d1d-b918-3b93e844a227",
                        "entry_id": "1473e30f-9231-35c6-bf92-2e60f702a75c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. вносить, добавлять кислоту"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53f8fbce-4823-45f9-9876-6f4280be3e54",
                                "sense_id": "e5857027-db7b-3d1d-b918-3b93e844a227",
                                "text": "Затем следует промывка на промывных машинах клапо, после чего товар кислуют серной кислотой с последующей смывкой, и после этого начинается беление."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "78e574f9-2371-46f3-8a94-ddd97e033c15",
                        "source_entry_id": "1473e30f-9231-35c6-bf92-2e60f702a75c",
                        "source_sense_id": "e5857027-db7b-3d1d-b918-3b93e844a227",
                        "target_lang_word": "sour",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sour",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "666ee84b-f1f4-3210-91f8-19b56cc1f27a",
                                        "entry_id": "267ad254-7e7b-3bbf-a7b5-44e781f18fe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tasting of acidity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63e6e2bc-e25b-4b66-a9fd-112528b3e883",
                                                "sense_id": "666ee84b-f1f4-3210-91f8-19b56cc1f27a",
                                                "text": "Lemons have a sour taste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d34f8460-75d4-43f0-ae1d-c7c825ef99e2",
                                                "sense_id": "666ee84b-f1f4-3210-91f8-19b56cc1f27a",
                                                "text": "All sour things, as vinegar, provoke appetite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bfb530b-6a2e-49f1-a315-f842cbd26206",
                                                "sense_id": "666ee84b-f1f4-3210-91f8-19b56cc1f27a",
                                                "text": "A few types of molecules get sensed by receptors on the tongue. Protons coming off of acids ping receptors for \"sour.\" Sugars get received as \"sweet.\" Bitter, salty, and the proteinaceous flavor umami all set off their own neural cascades."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4f254f1-a292-3e57-b351-82c1d1dec372",
                                        "entry_id": "267ad254-7e7b-3bbf-a7b5-44e781f18fe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Made rancid by fermentation, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dad78250-c631-46da-9229-6e2fd40f4b8c",
                                                "sense_id": "d4f254f1-a292-3e57-b351-82c1d1dec372",
                                                "text": "Don't drink that milk; it's turned sour."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9f6c9e8-40b6-3d04-9cac-27039f6862c0",
                                        "entry_id": "267ad254-7e7b-3bbf-a7b5-44e781f18fe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tasting or smelling rancid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "954057ea-07c4-4fdd-8bfd-d0e606acc78f",
                                                "sense_id": "b9f6c9e8-40b6-3d04-9cac-27039f6862c0",
                                                "text": "His sour breath makes it unpleasing to talk to him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba5df966-30b1-3fda-bbcf-8b56b425d1c8",
                                        "entry_id": "267ad254-7e7b-3bbf-a7b5-44e781f18fe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hostile or unfriendly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a person's character"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85f7424e-a0f0-43e6-bbbc-70ffb42861d2",
                                                "sense_id": "ba5df966-30b1-3fda-bbcf-8b56b425d1c8",
                                                "text": "He gave me a sour look."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d09ed053-cfe4-480e-8235-f85300ce6724",
                                                "sense_id": "ba5df966-30b1-3fda-bbcf-8b56b425d1c8",
                                                "text": "He was a scholar […] / Lofty and sour to them that loved him not, / But to those men that sought him sweet as summer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7aea208c-09b0-3a78-8f6c-465291dba165",
                                        "entry_id": "267ad254-7e7b-3bbf-a7b5-44e781f18fe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excessively acidic and thus infertile. (of soil)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6238ff7-ee9c-4a50-8164-b43748248402",
                                                "sense_id": "7aea208c-09b0-3a78-8f6c-465291dba165",
                                                "text": "sour land"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83ea3674-3e8e-418a-8ca0-a2eeac24832c",
                                                "sense_id": "7aea208c-09b0-3a78-8f6c-465291dba165",
                                                "text": "a sour marsh"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57aa9ac9-30c8-3390-908b-2cddb536a22c",
                                        "entry_id": "267ad254-7e7b-3bbf-a7b5-44e781f18fe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Containing excess sulfur. (of petroleum)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55c1c412-5aac-4d52-a420-c2bf9f154fc0",
                                                "sense_id": "57aa9ac9-30c8-3390-908b-2cddb536a22c",
                                                "text": "sour gas smells like rotten eggs"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad5433be-51a7-33d4-bc4d-ba1bdb4b1117",
                                        "entry_id": "267ad254-7e7b-3bbf-a7b5-44e781f18fe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unfortunate or unfavorable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38cd3ce6-36de-4b64-9f33-b427b764166d",
                                                "sense_id": "ad5433be-51a7-33d4-bc4d-ba1bdb4b1117",
                                                "text": "Let me embrace thee, sour adversity"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52df731f-2be0-4014-b73f-5416e24bdd35",
                                                "sense_id": "ad5433be-51a7-33d4-bc4d-ba1bdb4b1117",
                                                "text": "The result may not quite give the Wearsiders a sweet ending to what has been a sour week, following allegations of sexual assault and drug possession against defender Titus Bramble, but it does at least demonstrate that their spirit remains strong in the face of adversity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07380cb1-52ad-3beb-8511-92b76b8929ed",
                                        "entry_id": "267ad254-7e7b-3bbf-a7b5-44e781f18fe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Off-pitch, out of tune."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ec48cf1-f1be-4ae2-8c96-23bba652933f",
                                                "sense_id": "07380cb1-52ad-3beb-8511-92b76b8929ed",
                                                "text": "Unlike what the name implies, there is nothing inherently wrong with a sour note: It is perfectly well-tuned note that would sound normal in another context (and which presumably would not sound sour to someone unfamiliar with tonal music)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
